        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humanity went through 7 eras that made them collapse and then adapt, travel with your motorcycle to discover what they were. From the normality of the forest, a global drought... to the technological triumph that made them survive the universe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D arcade platform game that will challenge your abilities and reflexes. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advance through each level, demonstrating your skill, with progressive difficulty in each era, and collect gems to unlock the most difficult levels. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jump, avoid obstacles, or take advantage of them to achieve your goals, whether it's finishing early or being able to reach places you normally couldn't. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Control your speed with 3 base gears that will help you reach the goal and your objectives.</p></li></ul>",
